<p style="font-size: 16px;">Dear <strong><%= @event.user.username %></strong>,</p>

<p style="font-size: 16px;">We are pleased to inform you that your event titled <strong><%= @event.title %></strong> has
  been successfully submitted on the SciLifeLab Training Portal.</p>

<p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;">Event Details:</p>
<ul style="list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 15px;">
  <li><strong>Event Title:</strong> <%= @event.title %></li>
  <li><strong>URL:</strong>
    <a href="<%= @event.url %>" style="color: #045C64; text-decoration: none;"><%= event_url(@event) %></a></li>
  <li><strong>Start Date:</strong> <%= @event.start.strftime('%d %B %Y') %></li>
  <li><strong>End Date:</strong> <%= @event.end.strftime('%d %B %Y') %></li>
</ul>

<p style="font-size: 16px;">You can view and manage your event using the link below:</p>
<a href="<%= event_url(@event) %>"
   style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #045C64; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;">
  View Event
</a>

<!--if user is not the trusted user, he will receive the instruction on what is going to happen with the event next  -->
<% unless @event.user.has_role?('trusted_user') %>
  <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 20px;">Next steps for your event:</p>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 15px;">
    <li>Your event has been submitted for review by our administrators.</li>
    <li>If approved, the event will be published and visible to the public on the SciLifeLab Training Portal.</li>
    <li>If the event requires any changes, you will receive an email with the suggested improvements.</li>
    <li>If the event is declined, you will receive an email with the reason for the decision, and the event will be removed from the portal.</li>
  </ul>
<% end %>

<p style="font-size: 16px;">We appreciate your contribution and look forward to seeing your event on
  our platform.</p>

<p style="font-size: 16px;">Thank you for being a part of our community!</p>

<p style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;">Best regards,</p>
<p style="font-size: 16px;">The SciLifeLab Training Portal Team</p>
